 upgrade brings you closer to humanity\u2019s rebirth.","steam_appid":1783560,"support_info":{"email":"support@channel37.co","url":"https://thelastcaretaker.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://thelastcaretaker.com"}